      ],
      "text": "Mission Control is described as a self-hosted control plane for operating AI agents: dispatching tasks, inspecting runs, reviewing failures, tracking spend, and coordinating runtimes from a local dashboard backed by SQLite."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_881fd3310242eacce597cdc31baa3afa64859eeff23f9fbb4deede013d8d3894",
