          "git_sha": "07a29e050ee02f1104d1c5793eac6ad54b37bcd3",
          "line_end": 74,
          "line_start": 73,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "builderz-labs/mission-control",
          "url": "https://github.com/builderz-labs/mission-control/blob/5483a0e1eef15b467c167e95796791112cedbb7c/README.md#L73-L74"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1d7f0b16d7eeee31fcd33af6c77862a0fcca9a641683ea3f3b72b0bcec388d51"
      ],
      "text": "The control plane sits above agent runtimes and does not replace their reasoning or tool loops; it provides operators a single place to observe and govern work around those loops."
    },
