      "text": "Shipped surfaces include task inbox/assignment/review with an Aegis quality gate and completion receipts, agent registration and sessions, activity/schedules/alerts/webhooks/cost views, memory browser and skills registry, and governance features like roles, API keys, approvals, audits, and evals."
